<mxCell id="b461" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; 1/9: (3,3), (3,6), (6,3), (6,6) out of 36. The dice are independent, so multiplying is valid." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="376" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
