<mxCell id="b1140" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; The exclusive stop skips d = √n, which is the only factor of 4, 9, 25. Use math.isqrt(n) + 1 (also avoids float error)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="318" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
